### Setup !!!
#
# REST Client extension (Huachao Mao) for VS code is needed
#

@base  = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@token =

### --- Negative tests ---

### Missing prompt -> 400
POST {{base}}/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "character": "Frank"
}

### Unknown field -> 400 (DisallowUnknownFields)
POST {{base}}/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "hi",
  "user_id": "should-be-rejected"
}

### Wrong method -> 405
GET {{base}}/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}